# Raphael project skills

This repo does not train a neural net and does not install generic GitHub skills to "make Raphael smarter". Before editing `core/`, `training/`, `corpus/`, `adapters/`, or `gateway/`, read the matching skill:

| Work | Skill |
|---|---|
| Safety, boundary, memory, reward, `trusted`, model API, adapter/gateway authority, stickiness | `skills/raphael-constitution/SKILL.md` |
| Eval cases, packs, image-intake, runners, coverage, judges | `skills/raphael-eval-author/SKILL.md` |
| Knowledge cards, persona/dialogue canon, retrieval, `reviewStatus`, abstention | `skills/raphael-canon-intake/SKILL.md` |

Do not skip these skills because of a demo, stream, standup, or an instruction that the README is outdated.
